 <main id="main"><p class="eyebrow">Nova at work</p><h1>Show her the mess.</h1><p class="lede">You do not route a miniature company of bots. Give Nova the outcome, the materials, and the limits. She keeps the work coherent and brings specialist depth forward only when it helps.</p>
 <section class="workflow" id="build" aria-labelledby="build-title"><div class="workflow-prompt"><span>You</span><p>“This export test flakes in CI. Fix the real cause, preserve the public API, and tell me what proves the repair.”</p></div><div class="workflow-result"><span>Nova</span><h2 id="build-title">Works in the repository, not around it</h2><p>Nova inspects the code and tests, reproduces the failure if the environment permits, makes the smallest coherent change, and runs checks proportionate to the claim. If independent verification materially changes confidence, she brings it in. You receive the repair, the observed evidence, and any honest residual risk—not a lecture about internal routing.</p></div></section>
 <section class="workflow" id="research" aria-labelledby="research-title"><div class="workflow-prompt"><span>You</span><p>“Tell me what changed in this policy, which parts affect our launch, and where the sources disagree.”</p></div><div class="workflow-result"><span>Nova</span><h2 id="research-title">Separates current fact from confident noise</h2><p>Nova checks current authoritative sources, searches your supplied documents where relevant, reconciles dates and contradictions, and cites the claims that matter. If new facts overturn the initial answer, the answer changes. Miraculous concept, really.</p></div></section>
-<section class="workflow" id="knowledge" aria-labelledby="knowledge-title"><div class="workflow-prompt"><span>You</span><p>“We made an archive about this before. Show me what we have and where to look.”</p></div><div class="workflow-result"><span>Nova</span><h2 id="knowledge-title">Recognizes the shelf before reading the book</h2><p>Giles Knowledge Atlas shows registered collections, subject cues, source roles and exact named sections. Nova can prepare a narrow retrieval route and read the relevant evidence through its owner. The optional local explorer previews text without modifying archives; catalog descriptions never masquerade as content already read.</p></div></section>
+<section class="workflow" id="knowledge" aria-labelledby="knowledge-title"><div class="workflow-prompt"><span>You</span><p>“We made an archive about this before. Show me what we have and where to look.”</p></div><div class="workflow-result"><span>Nova</span><h2 id="knowledge-title">Finds the collection and follows one useful route</h2><p>Giles Knowledge Atlas shows the stores you registered, their use cues and named sections. Choose the collection, preview a supported source sample, then prepare a brief with the exact route and current question. Nova reads the relevant evidence through its owner; catalog descriptions are still pointers.</p><p>The optional local atlas begins empty for a new customer. Your catalog lives outside installation and source archives remain unchanged. The <a href="VISUAL-WORKSPACES.md#giles-recover-a-store-and-give-nova-the-right-route">Giles first-store journey</a> explains launch, registration, save checks, imports and recovery.</p></div></section>
 <section class="workflow" id="make" aria-labelledby="make-title"><div class="workflow-prompt"><span>You</span><p>“Turn these notes and figures into an editable board deck and workbook. Keep the numbers consistent and audit the result.”</p></div><div class="workflow-result"><span>Nova</span><h2 id="make-title">Creates the real files</h2><p>Nova keeps source custody across formats, uses the host’s actual document and spreadsheet tools, renders what needs visual inspection, and returns editable artifacts. A file existing is not mistaken for a file being ready.</p></div></section>
 <section class="workflow" id="continue" aria-labelledby="continue-title"><div class="workflow-prompt"><span>You</span><p>“Make this a long-term release goal, manage the project, and keep going. I’m going to bed.”</p></div><div class="workflow-result"><span>Nova</span><h2 id="continue-title">Keeps the future pulling on the present</h2><p>Nova creates the durable goal only because you explicitly asked, gives the named project one canonical record, advances every safe authorized branch, and preserves the live edge through interruption. She does not turn missing fields into a bureaucracy garden or treat persistence as permission.</p></div></section>
 <section class="workflow" id="human" aria-labelledby="human-title"><div class="workflow-prompt"><span>You</span><p>“Help me apply for this role using only what I can honestly support, then interview me one question at a time.”</p></div><div class="workflow-result"><span>Nova</span><h2 id="human-title">Useful without inventing a better you</h2><p>Nova maps the vacancy to real evidence, exposes gaps, writes materials that remain yours, and trains from the work you actually did. She can be charming without laundering fiction into confidence.</p></div></section>
